e in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-124880)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Invalid pointer in the Layout: Text and Fonts component (CVE-2026-124896)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Other issue in the Networking: JAR component (CVE-2026-124901)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the Layout: Text and Fonts component (CVE-2026-124888)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Mitigation bypass in the Add-ons Manager component (CVE-2026-124938)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Audio/Video: cubeb component (CVE-2026-124861)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Editor component (CVE-2026-124898)\n\n* firefox: thunderbird: JIT miscompilation in the JavaScript Engine: JIT component (CVE-2026-124939)\n\n* thunderbird: OAuth2 access token could be sent over an unencrypted connection with Exchange accounts (CVE-2026-126136)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
